{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1417296-exigent-idea-chosen-of-the-firstborn","id":1417296,"title":"Exigent Idea - Chosen of the Firstborn","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Exigents"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-08T03:13:57-07:00","id":1417296,"title":"Exigent Idea - Chosen of the Firstborn","content":"So, Exalted hive mind, if an Exigent was granted to Asna Firstborn, what kind of powers do you think a Chosen of the First Pattern Spider would express?<br /> <br /> To me, it seems like it'd be a fascinating hybrid or bridge between Sidereals and Alchemicals, as well as powers themed around arachnids and the Magical Materials.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3052-blackshade10","name":"blackshade10","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-10T04:54:20-07:00","id":1417533,"title":"","content":"The only non-Sidereal, non-Solar ever known to master Charcoal March of Spiders Style...<br /> <br /> Probably something around crafting automata, since one of her main things is being the mother of pattern spiders. Autochthon has this thing about self-replicating beings (he did the same with the First of the Mountain Folk)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":456,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/456-blackwell","user":"Blackwell","date":". 10-10-2020, 07:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/456-blackwell","name":"Blackwell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"977"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-18T17:45:56-08:00","id":1500682,"title":"","content":"Must admit that upon reading the title my initial thought was &quot;why would the First of the Jadeborn pray for an Exigence in the first place?&quot;<br /> <br /> Funny that i would mix two major creations of Autochton in retrospect, but i guess the elephant stands in the room still - &quot;why would she want such a champion, specially if it costs at least a part of her spark&quot;?<br /> <br /> Asna doesn't have much, if any interaction with Yu-shan outside of the Loom, what to say of Creation proper, considerable fate-weaving powers matched only by the Maidens or her most powerful chosen, acess to those same Maidens and chosen, not to mention the countless hordes of her childer-subordinates. What incredibly peculiar set of circunstances would inspire Firstborn to pray to the Unconquered Sun for exigence as a solution?<br /> <br /> MOTIVE is that most important factor that i feel like it's terribly missing here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 05-09-2024, 11:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-19T02:19:34-08:00","id":1500709,"title":"","content":"The Weaver (Adversaries page 172, not WoD) is a Pattern Spider much more likely to diminish itself to bestow its powers on a human. Though I don't think Pattern Spiders are considered gods anymore and if that's the case they can't technically use the Exigence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-19T02:50:52-08:00","id":1500710,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1417296-exigent-idea-chosen-of-the-firstborn?p=1500709#post1500709\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Weaver (Adversaries page 172, not WoD) is a Pattern Spider much more likely to diminish itself to bestow its powers on a human. Though I don't think Pattern Spiders are considered gods anymore and if that's the case they can't technically use the Exigence.</div> </div> </div> </div>One more reason to give the book a good look either way imho. That said, would them be considered something closer to demons/devas or elementals in 3e or something else altogether then?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-19T06:48:02-08:00","id":1500725,"title":"","content":"My understanding is they're now a category onto themselves as are Animal Avatars, though in the latter case that's a return to early 1st edition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}